<title>USA: US T-bond up full point after Greenspan remarks.</title>
<headline>US T-bond up full point after Greenspan remarks.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US T-bond extends gains, up full point in buying spree.</p>
<p>*30-yr bond yield slips to 6.46 pct, lowest since Dec 5.</p>
<p>*Greenspan Humphrey-Hawkins Congress testimony spurs gains.</p>
<p>*Fed Chairman says economic growth slowing.</p>
<p>*FOMC sees modest inflation in 1997, but rise in 1998.</p>
</text>
